          "end": 111.03,
          "en": "you have a recent commit with the new changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 111.03,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "and then it will also have the parent commit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 115.91499999999999,
          "en": "Why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 115.91499999999999,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "Because if the files which have not changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 119.52000000000001,
          "en": "is then the previous commit, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 119.52000000000001,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "So basically it'll have a pointer as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "So we'll see that later how the parent look like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 126.78,
          "en": "So we, it create a parent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
