          "end": 129.24099999999999,
          "en": "So it also has a parent, it has a checksum,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 129.24099999999999,
          "end": 130.47,
          "en": "and multiple things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 132.15,
          "en": "It also save data in a tree format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 132.15,
          "end": 134.25,
          "en": "But just to keep it simple, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 134.25,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "we have checksum and the commit ID, or the commit hash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "So the main is pointing to the new commit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 141.57,
          "en": "The head is pointed to new commit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 141.57,
          "end": 143.04,
          "en": "And now we are doing one more commit.",
